OL,3,GNEWSAInquest into death of man who died
OL,4,Aafter police arrest opens
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn inquest has opened into the death of
OL,7,Fa man who died after being arrested.
OL,9,FDavid Brown, 41, collapsed at his
OL,10,Fpartner's home on 21 August 2024 after
OL,11,Fbeing released from St Anne's Street
OL,12,Fpolice station in Liverpool.
OL,14,FAn inquest heard that his partner told
OL,15,Fparamedics he had swallowed 10 #30 bags
OL,16,Fof cocaine.
OL,18,FThe hearing - before a jury at Wirral
OL,19,FCoroners Court - is expected to last
OL,20,Ffive days.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
